title: partnership revision (2026)

@partnership_revision_2026
# prose-audit: Grade B — Kotula, Kosiniak-Kamysz and the President now answer for the promised return, the hidden vote-gain formula is removed from view, and the single record choice distinguishes enactment, veto and renewed defeat; this remains a short callback rather than a new negotiation.
title: The narrower partnership bill returns
subtitle: Kosiniak-Kamysz promised another vote; Kotula has brought back what survived the bargaining
face-image: img/poland/events/pride-march-2025.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 35
order: 6
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and partnership_revision_pending = 1 and time >= partnership_revision_due_time and marriage_reform_settled = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.partnership_revision_pending = 0;
const revisionGain = Math.max(
    2,
    Math.min(
        18,
        7 + Math.round(((Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0) - 35) / 5)
    )
);
Q.partnership_revision_gain = revisionGain;
Q.partnership_revision_yes = Math.min(
    Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460,
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.partnership_sejm_yes) || 0) + revisionGain
);
Q.partnership_revision_no = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.partnership_sejm_no) || 0) - revisionGain
);
Q.partnership_revision_passed =
    Q.partnership_revision_yes > Q.partnership_revision_no ? 1 : 0;
const revisionHostilePresident =
    Q.pres_2025_hostile_president || [
        "Andrzej Duda", String(Q.pres_2025_right_candidate || ""),
        "Sławomir Mentzen", "Grzegorz Braun"
    ].includes(Q.president_name);
Q.partnership_revision_enacted =
    Q.partnership_revision_passed &&
    (!revisionHostilePresident || Number(Q.president_relation) >= 48)
        ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.partnership_revision_enacted) {
    Q.partnership_revision_result =
        "The narrower bill passed and received presidential signature";
    Q.partnership_implementation_pending = 1;
    Q.partnership_implementation_due_time = (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 1;
    Q.minority_safety += 4;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 9;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += -4;
    Q.news_headline = "The promised narrower partnership law is enacted";
} else if (Q.partnership_revision_passed) {
    Q.partnership_revision_result =
        "The narrower bill passed but met another presidential veto";
    Q.president_relation -= 4;
    Q.president_veto_count = (Number(Q.president_veto_count) || 0) + 1;
    Q.news_headline = "The Palace vetoes the narrower partnership bill";
} else {
    Q.partnership_revision_result =
        "The narrower bill failed its new Sejm vote";
    Q.public_trust -= 1;
    Q.news_headline = "The promised partnership revision fails in the Sejm";
}
!}

= The promise comes back to the chamber

After the earlier defeat or veto, <span class="party-psl"><b>Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz</b></span> promised a dated
return for hospital access, tenancy and inheritance. <span class="party-lewica"><b>Katarzyna Kotula</b></span> has
brought that narrower text back rather than allowing the promise to disappear
into committee. The new division is **[+ partnership_revision_yes +] yes · [+
partnership_revision_no +] no**.

[? if partnership_revision_enacted: The Sejm passes it and **[+ president_name
+]** signs. The compromise is smaller than the status Lewica first sought, but
it is now law and the implementation clock has begun.?]
[? if partnership_revision_passed and not partnership_revision_enacted: The
Sejm passes it; **[+ president_name +]** vetoes even this reduced text. PSL can
no longer describe further narrowing as the obvious route to assent.?]
[? if not partnership_revision_passed: The revised bill fails in the Sejm.
Deputies who asked Lewica to accept less have not supplied the votes even for
less.?]

- @partnership_revision_record

@partnership_revision_record
title: Make every author of the compromise own its result
subtitle: Enactment moves to scrutiny; a veto or defeat moves to a public account of who reduced the bill and who still refused it.
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 3 if partnership_revision_enacted = 1; progressive_credibility -= 2 if partnership_revision_enacted = 0; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 7; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += 6

[? if partnership_revision_enacted: Lewica publishes a guide to the new rights
and assigns local legal-aid offices to watch the first cases. Kotula claims the
law without calling it equality; Kosiniak-Kamysz must defend the practical
protections he helped cut down and finally enact.?]
[? if partnership_revision_passed and not partnership_revision_enacted: Lewica
prints the two successful Sejm divisions beside the presidential veto. The
Palace owns the blockage now, while PSL must decide whether it wants an
override campaign or another retreat.?]
[? if not partnership_revision_passed: The division list goes back to every
constituency with the successive drafts attached. The promised parliamentary
route is exhausted; equality organisers, not another private bargain, set the
next demand.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the account
